 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Participle with complements",
     "texto": [
      "A participle can take words that accompany it and go before the noun: **die vor zwei Jahren gebaute Brücke** (the bridge built two years ago). The participle with its complements all goes before the noun. If the phrase is very long, it is better to use a relative clause: **die Brücke, die vor zwei Jahren gebaut wurde**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Time, place and manner",
     "texto": [
      "With the participle of an action verb, the words that accompany it follow the normal order: time, place and manner. **die gestern in Berlin gesehene Ausstellung** (the exhibition seen yesterday in Berlin)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Full form",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Equivalent with relative",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Translation",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
